#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:2
msgid "CBAM：哪里重要 + 什么重要"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`se-net` 让 CNN "
"学会了\"看什么\"（通道注意力）。但只看\"什么\"不够——**同一个特征在不同空间位置的意义完全不同**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:6
msgid "一张猫的图片中，\"耳朵\"特征出现在画面中央和出现在背景角落，含义天差地别。登山者不会在整个山壁上均匀用力——他们先看\"抓什么\"（裂缝还是岩棱），再看\"抓哪里\"（这个裂缝的中间段还是末端）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"CBAM（Convolutional Block Attention Module）{cite}`woo2018cbam` "
"把这两个问题合并成一个答案：**先选频道，再调区域**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:12
msgid "空间注意力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:14
msgid ""
"空间注意力（Spatial "
"Attention）的目标是生成一个**空间注意力图**——与输入特征图同等宽高的二维权重图，重要的区域更亮，不重要的更暗。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:16
msgid "空间注意力的直觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:19
msgid "通道注意力是\"给每个频道调音量\"，空间注意力则是 **\"给屏幕的每个区域调亮度\"**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"输入特征图 $F \\in \\mathbb{R}^{C \\times H \\times W}$，空间注意力模块生成注意力图 $M_s "
"\\in \\mathbb{R}^{1 \\times H \\times W}$："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\tilde{F} = F \\odot M_s"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:28
msgid "**关键问题**：如何从 $C$ 个通道生成 $1$ 个通道的空间注意力图？答案是**沿通道维度聚合信息**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid "最常用的方法来自 CBAM {cite}`woo2018cbam`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:32
msgid "**通道池化**：对每个空间位置，分别计算该位置在所有通道上的平均值和最大值"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:33
msgid "**拼接**：把两个聚合图拼成 $2 \\times H \\times W$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:34
msgid "**卷积**：用 $7 \\times 7$ 卷积将 $2$ 个通道压缩回 $1$ 个通道"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:35
msgid "**激活**：Sigmoid 映射到 $(0,1)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid "M_s = \\sigma(f^{7\\times7}([\\text{AvgPool}^c(F); \\text{MaxPool}^c(F)]))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:41
msgid "为什么同时用平均池化和最大池化？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:44
msgid "平均池化捕获\"该位置的整体激活强度\"，最大池化捕获\"该位置的最强响应\"。两者互补。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:51
msgid "通道注意力（选频道）与空间注意力（调区域）的输入输出对比"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:54
msgid "CBAM：通道 + 空间，两个都要"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:56
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`se-net` "
"解决了\"什么特征重要\"（通道维度）。空间注意力解决了\"哪里重要\"（空间维度）。那么问题来了：**能不能两个都要？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"CBAM（Convolutional Block Attention Module）{cite}`woo2018cbam` "
"就是答案——它把通道注意力和空间注意力串联起来，形成一个更强大的注意力模块。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:60
msgid "核心思想：先\"选频道\"再\"调区域\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:62
msgid "CBAM 的工作流程很直观：先判断哪些通道重要（通道注意力），再判断这些重要通道中的哪些空间位置最关键（空间注意力）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:64
msgid "CBAM的直觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:67
msgid "想象你在看一张照片找猫："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:68
msgid "**通道注意力**：首先，你决定看\"颜色\"这个维度（而不是\"纹理\"或\"亮度\"），因为猫的颜色信息最有用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:69
msgid "**空间注意力**：然后，你在\"颜色\"维度下，聚焦到照片中特定的区域——猫所在的位置。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/cbam.md:71
msgid "这就是 CBAM 的两步走：先\"选对频道\"，再\"看对位置\"。"
msgstr ""

